    <Callout title="Hemp is not a workaround for cannabis licensing" type="warning">
      Growing high-THC cannabis under a hemp license is a violation. DACF licenses hemp at ≤0.3% total THC and clearly does not license high-THC marijuana, which requires OCP adult-use or the medical program. Over-limit hemp is destroyed at the grower's expense.
    </Callout>

